# Unlocking a Myth: Ranger (jeuno 112): the trade, the weapon unworn. Accepted by a GM, a level 75 RNG with the
# KillerBow at 250 weapon skill points (xi.equipment.vigilWeaponRequiredWsPoints: 250) and a Bone Chip: the chip: nil
# (no message); the weapon: 10088 (11), finished: completed (no reward table), MYTHIC_LEARNED (11), Trueflight learned,
# the weapon kept. Completed: no section: 10085 (his default).
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10088
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=RNG lvl=75
quest Jeuno.UnlockingAMythRanger accepted
item KillerBow wsp=250
item BoneChip
login
trade Zalsuhm BoneChip x1               # not the weapon: nil
trade Zalsuhm KillerBow x1              # 250 >= 250: 10088 (11)
finish                                  # completed; MYTHIC_LEARNED (11); Trueflight; the weapon kept
trigger Zalsuhm                         # completed: no section; 10085
finish
